he brightness threshold and with-plate vs after-expiry differed by only 22 px - indistinguishable from 'still gone'. Re-captured inside the hold to measure at peak. (7) Retired a now-false claim in the file that made it: ui.tierBanner.test.ts's header said the banner's visual placement 'remains genuinely unverified... the owner's eye to judge'.",
