    "S127 CI x4 (PARKED, not dropped): permanent soak window/threshold shape (BLOCKED: needs the Mon 2026-08-03 07:00 UTC cron sample - TODAY, but unreadable while gh auth is invalid; do NOT decide on n=3-4) | worker-isolate ceiling 10MB->~3MB (BLOCKED: readWorkerFloorMB() is a single read at worker-heap.spec.ts:182, outside the stabilization loop at :174-181) | Playwright deviceScaleFactor raster lever (needs before/after) | e2e/** outside tsconfig coverage",
    "OWNER ACTION, blocks everything: `gh auth login -h github.com` then `git push origin master && git push origin v0.5.2-pre-pivot`. Then the Pages `gh api -X PUT repos/:owner/:repo/pages -f build_type=workflow` -> verify live asset hash -> THEN optionally delete origin/gh-pages, IN THAT ORDER.",
    "OWNER ACTION, gates all of Phase 1: probe playtest `/?probe=1&regime=new&slots=8` -> rules B3 + B4.",
