    "NEW S130: BACKLOG.md:518-521 claims risks with a code anchor carry a `// V6-RISK(Rn):` comment. That carrier DOES NOT EXIST - grep returns exactly one hit, V6-RISK(B3) at dev/probeBootstrap.ts:26. Zero of R1-R23 has a code anchor; enforcement rides only the markdown row plus session-close verification[] bindings.",
