    "NEW S130 (supervisor, verified - NO Council leg raised it): scoring.ts:99's single-owner rule carries its own expiry - 'If a future cross-player bond feature [e.g. Steal] is ever added, revisit this single-owner rule.' Steal is a Phase 2 feature. When Steal lands, primA.placedBy alone STOPS being a safe victim key and the V6-0.3 victim field needs a both-endpoints rule.",
