      "estimate_lesson": "Micro estimates were the least reliable, both OVER. The pattern: a Micro scope line names the ARTIFACT ('add a gating step', 'add a plate') and silently omits the seam needed to make it testable — a job-graph parse, a pure geometry function, an inner container. For this codebase, budget the testability seam INTO the Micro estimate, because the project's standing failure mode makes shipping it untested not an option."
