    "retrospective": {
      "what_worked": [
        "Splitting the CHECK panel by what each leg can actually VERIFY. Internal agents that can open files found 4 surviving mutations by RUNNING them; the external models, given design-level questions instead of a diff they cannot check, returned a real logic bug and an independent protocol-skew confirmation. Zero fabricated symbols this session — against a documented history of them.",
        "Driving genuine emitters rather than injecting payloads. Setting the leader's score to STEP-1 and dispatching through the app's own controls.dispatchFn made the producer part of the evidence, not an assumption.",
        "Proving ABSENCE as well as presence (toast band 0 -> 3759 -> 0 warm px). Verifying a feature appears is half a test; the plate's new failure mode was outliving its label.",
        "Refusing three PDR instructions that were factually wrong, and recording each refusal with evidence instead of silently skipping or blindly complying."
